notes.content:
Thanks utopia for providing BUG description
BUG fix:
1. Repair the abnormal problem of heal skills caused by the loss of animation resources;
2. Fixed the problem that the game will not be over if the final month fails. After the repair, the old save can be played for next month and then over;
3. Fix the problem that the heal skill will be casted when full of HP;

New features:
1. Added the automatic archive function. The path is the save folder in the game directory. It is divided into the last manual archive (game.dat_manual) and the last automatic archive (game.dat_auto). If there is a problem with the archive, you can manually restore it (it should not be this question);
2.3 additional difficulties will no longer be opened at the beginning, you need to clear the previous difficulty before unlocking;
